# A307639

Irregular array T(n, k) read by rows, where row n lists the members of n-th Fermat pseudoprime tuple. Rows are arranged first by size of largest term, then by increasing length of row, then in lexicographic order.

The 68 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

